{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"The nameless replies in perfect Sylvan. \"Ahh, that was your problem. Well, I said, there re guns that aren't made of wood you know.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T04:42:37.878000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869802003935686666","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"The impression of a smile crosses the figure's face. \"Ah, it is good to speak in a comfortable tongue. As for the guns, I am well aware there are guns made out other materials, but these feel most natural to me and can be better used by those from the bright reflection.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T04:44:12.994000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-28T04:45:17.100000Z","id":"869802402881089546","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"The nameless resumes firing now that he knows that the gunshots weren't the issue. \"I just haven't heard of any wooden guns being used in tandem with metal ones. You from ferrytown? Or maybe the feywilds?\" He asks curiously.","created_at":"2021-07-28T04:45:32.841000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-28T04:45:52.625000Z","id":"869802737783693346","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"I am from myself, and maybe not even that. More i cannot say. but i suppose the fey are of my persuasion so that is a fair assumption.\" they resume firing as well","created_at":"2021-07-28T04:47:04.493000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869803122200019004","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
